1
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:52,599
Clothes! Clothes! Great clothes on sale!

2
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:54,640
Factory clearance blowout!

3
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,040
Massive clearance sale on everything! Big blowout!

4
00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,879
Everything for just 39 yuan!

5
00:02:00,159 --> 00:02:01,519
Everything for just 39 yuan!

6
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:04,359
Come on over, folks! Come take a look!

7
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:07,719
Massive clearance sale on everything! Big blowout!

8
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,719
Just 39 yuan each!

9
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,319
Only 39 yuan!

10
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,280
Real bargains for our shoppers!

11
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:17,039
Excuse me, Brother Wang, coming through.

12
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,159
Master Zhou.

13
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:20,840
You're out early today!

14
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:22,639
Yeah, got a busy day ahead.

15
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,120
Old Liu, I've got your pickles!

16
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:29,479
Great, I'll swing by your place later for them.

17
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:32,680
Sister Feng!

18
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:34,719
Sister Feng!

19
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,759
Coming, I'm coming!

20
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,199
Sister Feng!

21
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:39,439
Sister Feng!

22
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,319
You're finally here.

23
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:42,080
Sorry about that!

24
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,879
Good grief.

25
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,240
Things were busy at home,

26
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:44,520
so that's why...

27
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,039
Let me help hold that.

28
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:45,759
...I'm late.

29
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,520
I thought you were at home counting cash,

30
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,039
till your fingers cramped up!

31
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,319
What are you talking about?

32
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:52,039
How much did you get?

33
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,000
Nothing.

34
00:02:53,439 --> 00:02:54,319
Nothing?

35
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:54,719
Watch out!

36
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,280
Are you crazy?

37
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,360
You looked after him for nearly 20 years!

38
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,800
You got totally ripped off!

39
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:04,319
Sister Feng,

40
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,800
lately...

41
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,319
I've been tight on money.

42
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:10,599
Could you give me a few more orders next week?

43
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,400
I promise I'll deliver on time this time.

44
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:14,919
What about what I mentioned last time?

45
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:16,080
Have you thought it over?

46
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,479
To tell you the truth,

47
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:19,400
this shop of mine...

48
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,639
It's not like nobody wants it.

49
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:22,199
There's a whole line of people waiting.

50
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,280
I'll give you a discount.

51
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:23,840
Eighty thousand.

52
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,479
You take over the shop.

53
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,000
How about it?

54
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:27,759
Where would I get that kind of money?

55
00:03:28,719 --> 00:03:29,919
Even for my daughter's tutoring classes,

56
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,039
I don't even know where to scrape it up.

57
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,560
Don't look down on this small workshop.

58
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,719
It makes at least 70,000 or 80,000 a year.

59
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:37,759
Sure,

60
00:03:38,159 --> 00:03:39,680
it's not like your father-in-law's projects,

61
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,000
where big money rolls in fast.

62
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:41,919
But this money

63
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,439
is solid, honest income

64
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:45,000
going straight into your hands.

65
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,039
You won't have to walk on eggshells anymore.

66
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,879
I'll think it over when I get back.

67
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,039
Dad,

68
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:53,879
watch your step.

69
00:03:54,319 --> 00:03:54,639
Okay.

70
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:54,960
Dad,

71
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:55,800
we're only going for two days.

72
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,639
You can't go with him!

73
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,599
If you go, what am I supposed to do?

74
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:59,680
I'm just staying at your brother's for two days.

75
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,120
Dad, once you go, you won't be coming back!

76
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,240
It won't come to that.

77
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,599
Who said so? Dad and I already agreed!

78
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:04,319
You agreed with Dad,

79
00:04:04,319 --> 00:04:04,879
but Dad didn't agree with me!

80
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:05,759
Didn't we already agree?

81
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:06,120
Yeah!

82
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,719
The three of us...

83
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:08,280
No, I mean the three of us—you and your two sons,

84
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,319
split it equally,

85
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:10,479
three million each!

86
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,719
He's not doing this out of filial piety!

87
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,280
He just wants to cheat me out of the demolition payout!

88
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:14,960
No way...

89
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,240
Dad,

90
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,240
remember back when he got married?

91
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,839
You bought him an apartment in the city,

92
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,000
wiping out all your savings!

93
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,439
You even paid to find his wife a job!

94
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,439
What did I ever get?

95
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,560
And now I have to split this with him?

96
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:24,839
Do you think that's fair to me?

97
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:26,800
How have my wife and I treated you all these years?

98
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,879
I called home all the time,

99
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:29,759
and on holidays,

100
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:31,800
my wife and I always brought gifts!

101
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:33,279
Who truly cares about you?

102
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,680
You should know deep down in your heart!

103
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,720
You're really making me laugh.

104
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:36,839
Buying some cheap fruit for the holidays,

105
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:37,519
and you're taking credit for it?

106
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,199
Ma Laibu,

107
00:04:38,199 --> 00:04:39,759
shut up. Aren't you embarrassed?

108
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:41,240
Making you laugh?

109
00:04:41,279 --> 00:04:42,800
You're lucky you haven't driven Dad to his grave!

110
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,160
Sit tight!

111
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,199
What's wrong with me?

112
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:50,439
Old Sai,

113
00:04:51,279 --> 00:04:53,600
it's quite normal to get this at your age.

114
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,800
Frequent, urgent, and incomplete urination.

115
00:04:55,959 --> 00:04:57,079
If you trust me,

116
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,759
I'll prescribe some anti-inflammatories

117
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:01,199
and give you some painkillers.

118
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,480
If you don't trust me,

119
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,199
go to a big hospital in the city.

120
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:04,800
Remember,

121
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:06,560
see a urologist.

122
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:07,839
Urology.

123
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:08,360
Right.

124
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,040
Okay, okay.

125
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:09,600
Got it.

126
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:10,680
Thanks, Auntie Li.

127
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,759
Then try to hold them back.

128
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:12,600
All right, all right.

129
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,720
Got it. I'll be right back.

130
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,279
Jiao.

131
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:15,120
What is it now?

132
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,839
My eldest brother and third brother

133
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:19,399
are fighting over the demolition money again.

134
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,800
Dr. Zheng, I need to take some time off.

135
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,240
My family just can't sort out this money.

136
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,399
Wait, hold on.

137
00:05:24,399 --> 00:05:25,160
I'll go with you.

138
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:27,920
I'm coming with you.

139
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,240
Who're you pushing?

140
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,000
What are you doing?

141
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,600
Who're you laying hands on?

142
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:30,920
Eldest Brother!

143
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,759
What are you doing? You're blood brothers!

144
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:33,279
Eldest Brother!

145
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,439
Take it out on me!

146
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,360
Stop yelling!

147
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,959
You're stepping on your sister!

148
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:37,759
Stop fighting! Let go!

149
00:05:37,759 --> 00:05:39,240
You bastard! Get off me!

150
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:40,240
Shut up, all of you!

151
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,759
Think I'm scared to fight you?

152
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,639
Are you done yet?

153
00:05:43,839 --> 00:05:45,399
What if my son turns out like this?

154
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,040
Old Ma.

155
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,160
Let's go, let's go.

156
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,240
Come with me, come on.

157
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:48,920
Uncle, Uncle!

158
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,639
Let go of me!

159
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:51,120
This is our family business!

160
00:05:51,519 --> 00:05:52,360
Stay out of it!

161
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,319
Whose business?

162
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:57,800
Let's go, let's go.

163
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,439
The Ma family completely lost face today.

164
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:01,839
If it were me, I'd slap them across the face,

165
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:02,879
and see who dares make a sound.

166
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,680
How did I get stuck with these two bastards?

167
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,279
You're just too soft.

168
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:08,439
That won't do.

169
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,480
Let's go get a drink. Come on.

170
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,319
A drink.

171
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,040
Let's drink.

172
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,000
If you ask me,

173
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,920
it's all your fault.

174
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,759
Didn't I warn you?

175
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:18,600
Don't split the demolition money.

176
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:20,079
Split it, and trouble follows.

177
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:21,000
And now?

178
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,600
I called it, didn't I?

179
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:24,639
I just can't wrap my head around it.

180
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,000
We were just talking about splitting the money,

181
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,079
and they're still not satisfied!

182
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,279
How much is ever enough?

183
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,120
They preach about filial piety,

184
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,199
filial respect...

185
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,439
But deep down,

186
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,199
they can't wait for me to drop dead!

187
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,600
Just grabbing cash!

188
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,600
Don't be mad. Calm down.

189
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:42,720
Why dwell on it?

190
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:45,439
The kids will make their own way.

191
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:47,879
We can't stick with them forever.

192
00:06:48,399 --> 00:06:49,199
There's only one thing:

193
00:06:49,879 --> 00:06:50,920
as their father,

194
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,839
you've got to keep your spine straight.

195
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,439
When times get tough,

196
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,839
don't expect anyone to bail us out,

197
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:59,319
but you can't just surrender to fate.

198
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:01,879
We're fated to have sons and daughters,

199
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:04,240
but kids...

200
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,720
Some are born to repay your love,

201
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,560
and some are born just to collect debts.

202
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,680
Since they're here, we just have to take it.

203
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,560
I won't put up with them anymore!

204
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,079
Right.

205
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,759
If they act up again,

206
00:07:20,519 --> 00:07:21,480
I'll just find myself an old woman!

207
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:23,000
A house full of grown kids

208
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,360
isn't worth a late-life companion.

209
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,319
Since it's all about the money anyway,

210
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,079
an old woman would at least be upfront!

211
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:28,759
Let me tell you,

212
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:31,120
with your buzz cut, saggy belly, and wrinkles,

213
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:32,560
who'd even want you?

214
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,000
I've got money.

215
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:35,600
I'm rich!

216
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,199
Got the cash!

217
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:42,680
Dacheng!

218
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:43,879
Dacheng!

219
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:44,959
Dacheng!

220
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:45,720
Old Ma!

221
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,279
Somebody help! Quickly!

222
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,000
What happened?

223
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,680
Hurry! Old Ma!

224
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,800
Call an ambulance! We need an ambulance!

225
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,480
Call an ambulance, quick!

226
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:50,759
Okay!

227
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:51,480
Hurry! Hurry up!

228
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:59,399
Living to this age, Sai Duoxi

229
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,399
thought he had seen it all.

230
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,319
Yet a scene like this

231
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:06,959
was a first even for him.

232
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:11,240
The man is not even gone, yet the tea grows cold.

233
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,639
He could not help but wonder:

234
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:16,759
In this lifetime,

235
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,439
what are we all after?

236
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,439
Lai Jiao!

237
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,759
Bro!

238
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:25,639
Bro!

239
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,279
How is Dad?

240
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:27,519
Don't cry, don't cry.

241
00:08:27,759 --> 00:08:28,160
Don't cry.

242
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:28,839
What happened?

243
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:29,680
What is Dad's condition?

244
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,120
A hem... cerebral hemorrhage.

245
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:33,120
When did he go in?

246
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,200
Over 40 minutes ago.

247
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,240
How was he when he first arrived?

248
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:37,440
Un... unconscious.

249
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,279
Did they intubate him?

250
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:40,039
I don't know, Bro... Bro!

251
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:41,080
Stop crying first.

252
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,159
Calm down. Don't cry.

253
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,080
Did they administer medication?

254
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:45,960
How much did he drink, Uncle?

255
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,200
Dad usually drinks,

256
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,000
so why did this happen today?

257
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,759
Aren't you two buddies?

258
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,200
You know he has high blood pressure!

259
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,000
Was he drinking with you, Uncle?

260
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:53,039
You know he has high blood pressure!

261
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:54,519
How could you let him drink so much?

262
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:55,320
Get up!

263
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:55,840
Ma Laibu!

264
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,639
Get up!

265
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:57,320
Ma Laibu!

266
00:08:57,519 --> 00:08:58,360
What are you doing? Are you insane?

267
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:58,879
What are you doing?

268
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,240
Putting your hands on my dad?

269
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:00,919
Come at me if you've got the guts!

270
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:01,480
Just talk it out!

271
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,360
Looking for a fight?

272
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,399
Don't fight in the hospital!

273
00:09:03,399 --> 00:09:03,919
What's with the shouting?

274
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:04,799
Stop yelling!

275
00:09:04,799 --> 00:09:05,559
Don't fight!

276
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:06,200
Stop arguing!

277
00:09:06,639 --> 00:09:08,360
This is a hospital! What's the racket?

278
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:09,799
Get off me!

279
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:12,639
There you are!

280
00:09:13,159 --> 00:09:13,480
Jingran.

281
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,159
How is my dad?

282
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:15,200
He'll be fine. Don't worry.

283
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:17,360
Who is Ma Jiucheng's family?

284
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,240
I am.

285
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:18,720
We are.

286
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,480
I am, Doctor.

287
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,879
Since you are Director Jin's friends,

288
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,679
I will get straight to the point.

289
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,879
Your father suffered a sudden cerebral hemorrhage.

290
00:09:24,039 --> 00:09:26,000
The CT scan shows a basal ganglia hemorrhage.

291
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,080
Thalamic bleeding is nearing 30 ml.

292
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,759
Both surgical and conservative treatments are options.

293
00:09:30,799 --> 00:09:32,360
Doctor, how does the surgery work?

294
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,679
It requires a craniotomy.

295
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,720
Surgery carries risks.

296
00:09:35,159 --> 00:09:35,639
During the procedure,

297
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:37,480
there is a chance of damaging functional brain areas.

298
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:38,320
Post-surgery,

299
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,639
there might be complications,

300
00:09:40,039 --> 00:09:42,240
such as hemiplegia, aphasia, or sensory deficits.

301
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,480
What if we don't operate?

302
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,600
Then we can only manage it with medication

303
00:09:45,679 --> 00:09:47,120
and wait for the hematoma to absorb naturally.

304
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,600
However, that also carries risks.

305
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,080
If he doesn't respond well to medication

306
00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:51,679
and the hematoma keeps expanding,

307
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,840
the intracranial pressure will rise further.

308
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:55,320
You family members discuss it quickly:

309
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,919
surgery or no surgery.

310
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:58,720
If you agree,

311
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,639
sign this surgical consent form.

312
00:10:20,679 --> 00:10:21,120
Jingran,

313
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:25,159
what do you think?

314
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,919
I consulted a panel of specialists.

315
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,080
They couldn't agree on a treatment plan either.

316
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,639
I also asked our hospital director.

317
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,679
What did he say?

318
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,440
He said...

319
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,879
we'll get the best medical team and equipment,

320
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:36,240
but as for the specific treatment,

321
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,200
he can't make that call either.

322
00:10:37,519 --> 00:10:38,000
In the end,

323
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:39,600
it's up to the family.

324
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:43,919
The three of you,

325
00:10:44,759 --> 00:10:45,360
what's your take?

326
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:49,639
I'm asking you. Speak up!

327
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:53,559
Ma Laiqi.

328
00:10:54,759 --> 00:10:55,799
You're the eldest. You speak up.

329
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,440
Sure, I'm the oldest.

330
00:10:58,679 --> 00:10:59,120
That's right.

331
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:00,639
But...

332
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,360
but I'm not a doctor.

333
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:03,559
How can I decide?

334
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,879
You say something, Ma Laibu.

335
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:07,559
What?

336
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,360
I... I can't say.

337
00:11:09,679 --> 00:11:12,000
Come on, at least give an opinion!

338
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,159
If the eldest won't speak, how can I?

339
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:13,679
Shut up!

340
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:15,279
Haven't you disgraced yourselves enough?

341
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:19,320
If you don't care about your old man,

342
00:11:20,279 --> 00:11:22,080
I still care about my brother Ma!

343
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,320
Look at yourselves!

344
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:29,759
Jingran.

345
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:30,360
Dad.

346
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:32,120
Then...

347
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,360
I'll make the call for him.

348
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:35,240
Dad.

349
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:36,679
You can't make this call.

350
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,480
No surgery.

351
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:45,960
Conservative treatment.

352
00:11:46,679 --> 00:11:47,240
I'll go let them know.

353
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,080
All right, tell him.

354
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,919
Ma Jiucheng's family, please pay the bill.

355
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,240
Will someone from Ma Jiucheng's family pay the bill?

356
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:21,399
Give it to me.

357
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:44,840
Eldest Brother Sai,

358
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,279
you're coming with me.

359
00:12:46,279 --> 00:12:46,919
No, wait. Hold on, hold on.

360
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:47,320
I—

361
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,159
Why should my big brother go with you?

362
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:48,919
Why would I go with you?

363
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:50,759
You have to pay this too.

364
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:51,279
Come with me.

365
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,200
Me? I'm supposed to pay?

366
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,279
What do you mean by that?

367
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,360
What do you think I mean?

368
00:12:54,519 --> 00:12:55,960
Your dad drank my dad into the hospital!

369
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,480
Your family should pay for this!

370
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,679
It's compensation, you hear me?

371
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,159
Wait, what do you mean?

372
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,000
Are you trying to extort our family now?

373
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,279
Who's extorting you? That's just how it is!

374
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:01,960
Ma Laiqi,

375
00:13:02,399 --> 00:13:03,919
your dad is still lying in a hospital bed!

376
00:13:04,159 --> 00:13:04,639
So what?

377
00:13:05,679 --> 00:13:06,519
You heartless bastard!

378
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:07,720
You don't care if your dad lives or dies, huh?

379
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,480
If word gets back to the village,

380
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,360
or reaches your company,

381
00:13:10,559 --> 00:13:12,039
how will you ever show your face again?

382
00:13:12,279 --> 00:13:13,480
If you have no shame, fine!

383
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:14,720
Sue us!

384
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,200
Take us to court!

385
00:13:16,759 --> 00:13:17,879
If you win, good for you.

386
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,240
If you lose,

387
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:20,399
once your dad wakes up,

388
00:13:20,399 --> 00:13:22,399
I'll tell him every single detail of today.

389
00:13:22,639 --> 00:13:24,320
Don't you two want the demolition payout?

390
00:13:24,519 --> 00:13:25,639
You won't get a damn cent!

391
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:26,440
Fine.

392
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:27,799
Fine, fine, fine!

393
00:13:28,279 --> 00:13:29,960
Every last one of you in the Sai family,

394
00:13:30,639 --> 00:13:32,080
you're all born from foxes and monkeys!

395
00:13:32,279 --> 00:13:32,799
Who are you cursing at?

396
00:13:32,799 --> 00:13:33,279
Ma Laibu!

397
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:34,919
What are you standing around for?

398
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,320
Didn't you hear them?

399
00:13:36,679 --> 00:13:38,039
No payment, no split!

400
00:13:38,399 --> 00:13:38,960
Come pay with me!

401
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:41,919
I can pay the bill,

402
00:13:42,679 --> 00:13:43,879
but not because of the demolition payout!

403
00:13:46,879 --> 00:13:48,039
Alright, alright, show's over!

404
00:13:48,039 --> 00:13:49,360
What are you looking at? Nothing to see here!

405
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,240
Break it up! Move along!

406
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:51,039
Ridiculous jerks.

407
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:51,320
Dad.

408
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,000
Dad!

409
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,519
Why did you go making decisions for them?

410
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:53,879
Dad...

411
00:13:53,879 --> 00:13:54,399
What's wrong with me making decisions?

412
00:13:54,399 --> 00:13:55,320
What if he dies?

413
00:13:55,559 --> 00:13:56,039
Dad, you aren't—

414
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,159
Are you okay?

415
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,120
I'm fine.

416
00:13:58,399 --> 00:13:59,120
What are you panicking for?

417
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,200
I was worried sick!

418
00:14:00,399 --> 00:14:01,000
Don't worry, don't worry.

419
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,039
Jingran is inside.

420
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,039
Jiao.

421
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:06,960
Jiao!

422
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:08,639
Jiao, don't cry.

423
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:09,919
It's okay, it's alright.

424
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,279
I'm right here. I'm here.

425
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:15,799
Come on, honey.

426
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:27,919
How about

427
00:14:28,879 --> 00:14:29,559
we call the second brother back

428
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:30,919
and ask him about it?

429
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,519
Why call him back?

430
00:14:32,679 --> 00:14:33,559
Are you really afraid of the Mas?

431
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:35,679
Didn't he study law?

432
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,559
Ma Laiqi is yelling all over the place,

433
00:14:38,559 --> 00:14:39,799
demanding we pay the medical bills.

434
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,279
Shouldn't we consult someone in law

435
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:41,879
to get things straight?

436
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:42,440
No need to ask.

437
00:14:42,879 --> 00:14:44,759
Either way, this has nothing to do with us.

438
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:47,159
If you ask me, it's old man Ma's fault.

439
00:14:47,399 --> 00:14:48,399
He didn't divide it fairly.

440
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:49,279
No wonder the kids made a fuss.

441
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,519
Such a huge sum of money,

442
00:14:50,519 --> 00:14:52,039
and he split it just by flapping his gums.

443
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,960
If he'd gathered everyone together

444
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,159
to talk it over peacefully,

445
00:14:55,159 --> 00:14:55,840
they wouldn't have fought.

446
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,480
Number Three, you've got it wrong.

447
00:14:58,399 --> 00:15:00,120
Even in a huge family, one person calls the shots.

448
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,960
The bigger the issue, the less you debate it.

449
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,279
How can you discuss it with everyone chiming in?

450
00:15:04,519 --> 00:15:05,639
You have to listen to the head of the house.

451
00:15:06,799 --> 00:15:08,639
Siblings sitting down to talk it through,

452
00:15:08,759 --> 00:15:09,720
there's nothing wrong with that.

453
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,240
Enough already.

454
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:11,759
You haven't even sorted out

455
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:12,879
your own lives yet,

456
00:15:12,879 --> 00:15:14,159
so why butt into how the Mas split their money?

457
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:15,559
I'm just talking sense here.

458
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:16,399
No matter what, people should—

459
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,600
Are you done yet?

460
00:15:20,919 --> 00:15:21,919
Over money,

461
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,360
the Ma family tore apart.

462
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,039
What about the Sai family?

463
00:15:28,399 --> 00:15:30,720
With a house full of children,

464
00:15:31,279 --> 00:15:32,120
what would they do?

465
00:15:33,639 --> 00:15:35,080
Sai Duoxi was racked with worry.

466
00:15:47,919 --> 00:15:48,279
Come in.

467
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:50,679
Chief Song.

468
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:53,960
What is it?

469
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,240
Here's my resignation letter.

470
00:15:58,799 --> 00:16:00,679
I've submitted a copy to HR as well.

471
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:07,879
Thank you for mentoring me all these years.

472
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:11,559
Song Jianhui.

473
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,399
We're the Honggang City Discipline and Inspection Committee.

474
00:16:13,919 --> 00:16:14,639
You're suspected of disciplinary violations.

475
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,480
Please come with us to assist in the investigation.

476
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,679
Chief Song was just taken away.

477
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,360
Really?

478
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,720
What did he do?

479
00:16:34,159 --> 00:16:34,840
Who knows?

480
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:54,080
Hello?

481
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:55,440
Hello.

482
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,799
Is President Shi in?

483
00:16:57,279 --> 00:16:58,519
Hello, may I have your name?

484
00:16:59,279 --> 00:16:59,840
Sai Xiuliang.

485
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,080
I'm sorry, Mr. Sai.

486
00:17:01,519 --> 00:17:03,360
President Shi can't take your call right now.

487
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,640
You can leave a message,

488
00:17:04,799 --> 00:17:05,440
and I'll pass it along.

489
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,000
Never mind, then. Thanks.

490
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,160
Just a few days ago,

491
00:18:05,079 --> 00:18:06,480
the three of us brothers were drinking together.

492
00:18:07,319 --> 00:18:07,599
And now?

493
00:18:08,039 --> 00:18:09,400
One of us is bedridden.

494
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:12,839
And Duoxi...

495
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:14,960
That demolition compensation you're holding,

496
00:18:15,279 --> 00:18:17,279
give the kids an answer as soon as possible.

497
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,559
Even if you won't split it, say so clearly.

498
00:18:20,039 --> 00:18:21,440
Whatever your plans and arrangements are,

499
00:18:22,079 --> 00:18:23,359
make it clear to them soon.

500
00:18:27,039 --> 00:18:28,359
People are easily swayed by temptation.

501
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:30,759
Delay only invites trouble.

502
00:18:39,279 --> 00:18:39,720
Xiuhe.

503
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:40,640
What's up?

504
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:43,720
Dinner tonight.

505
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,039
The second brother is coming too?

506
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:50,119
All right, got it.

507
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:52,039
I'll let your sister-in-law know.

508
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:53,880
Sounds good.

509
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:58,880
What are you looking at? What's going on?

510
00:18:58,920 --> 00:18:59,279
Brother Ming.

511
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,160
What's everyone looking at?

512
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,039
Brother Ming, Brother Ming.

513
00:19:06,279 --> 00:19:06,599
Who is that?

514
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:09,119
The new site supervisor sent from above.

515
00:19:10,559 --> 00:19:11,920
He just arrived this morning.

516
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:13,720
Ruthless, strictly by the book.

517
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,880
Heard this kid...

518
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,599
graduated a few years ago with a civil engineering degree.

519
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,279
A college graduate?

520
00:19:20,319 --> 00:19:21,519
That's nothing special.

521
00:19:21,519 --> 00:19:22,079
Exactly.

522
00:19:22,079 --> 00:19:23,319
Still ends up on a construction site like us.

523
00:19:23,319 --> 00:19:23,920
Right?

524
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:26,359
The drilling depth for your rebar dowels

525
00:19:26,559 --> 00:19:27,200
isn't deep enough.

526
00:19:27,599 --> 00:19:28,799
The standard requires ten centimeters.

527
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:29,839
You only have nine.

528
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,599
And the spacing between tie bars...

529
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,240
Along the wall height, it can't exceed 500.

530
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,559
This is already at 600.

531
00:19:34,839 --> 00:19:35,559
Also, come over and look at this.

532
00:19:36,039 --> 00:19:37,279
This scaffolding won't do either.

533
00:19:37,839 --> 00:19:38,960
On your double-row scaffolding,

534
00:19:39,039 --> 00:19:41,559
continuous scissor braces must be set across the facade.

535
00:19:41,799 --> 00:19:42,720
And your layout workers

536
00:19:43,359 --> 00:19:44,279
aren't wearing hard hats.

537
00:19:44,519 --> 00:19:46,039
Regulations require fines for all of this.

538
00:19:46,039 --> 00:19:47,039
Put them on! Put them on!

539
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,839
What are you doing? I look away for a second,

540
00:19:48,839 --> 00:19:49,880
and you take off your hard hats?

541
00:19:51,279 --> 00:19:52,160
You trying to get us fined?

542
00:19:52,799 --> 00:19:53,319
Let me hear it.

543
00:19:53,599 --> 00:19:54,400
How much do you want to fine us?

544
00:19:54,759 --> 00:19:55,200
5,000.

545
00:19:55,839 --> 00:19:56,680
Come on, brother, that's going too far.

546
00:19:57,039 --> 00:19:58,039
Brother, it's not that serious.

547
00:19:58,960 --> 00:19:59,279
All right, all right.

548
00:19:59,559 --> 00:20:00,519
Stop writing! Stop writing!

549
00:20:00,519 --> 00:20:02,279
Come over here.

550
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:04,480
Young man,

551
00:20:05,079 --> 00:20:05,480
let's...

552
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:07,400
talk this out reasonably.

553
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,240
Don't act like a big shot.

554
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,039
Failed inspection.

555
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:12,519
Rectify and rework within the time limit.

556
00:20:12,559 --> 00:20:13,519
Then reapply for reinspection.

557
00:20:13,839 --> 00:20:15,079
Fail again, and you'll be fined again.

558
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:16,519
Let's go.

559
00:20:17,039 --> 00:20:18,039
Quite a temper on this kid.

560
00:20:20,119 --> 00:20:20,720
Get to work, get back to work!

561
00:20:21,519 --> 00:20:22,319
What are you all crowding around for?

562
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:35,559
What's wrong? Why didn't they approve it again?

563
00:20:36,519 --> 00:20:37,960
Didn't I tell you over the phone?

564
00:20:38,839 --> 00:20:39,359
This construction site...

565
00:20:39,359 --> 00:20:40,200
is seriously cursed.

566
00:20:40,319 --> 00:20:40,680
Just think.

567
00:20:41,319 --> 00:20:42,079
The old one left,

568
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:43,240
and now a young one showed up.

569
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:43,920
Look at this.

570
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,240
Are they both out to jinx me?

571
00:20:45,319 --> 00:20:46,680
Maybe I... I should just quit.

572
00:20:46,839 --> 00:20:47,920
I've had enough of this, day in and day out.

573
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:48,880
Guo Haifeng.

574
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:50,000
By the way,

575
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:50,960
uh...

576
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:53,000
did the third brother call you?

577
00:20:53,359 --> 00:20:54,319
He wants to have dinner together tonight.

578
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:56,240
Said the second brother and Meifan

579
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,119
are coming along too.

580
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,359
What kind of dinner?

581
00:20:58,799 --> 00:20:59,279
He didn't say.

582
00:21:01,319 --> 00:21:01,640
We're not going.

583
00:21:02,079 --> 00:21:03,039
Just tell him we're busy at the site.

584
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:03,440
Wait,

585
00:21:03,519 --> 00:21:05,519
why not go for a meal?

586
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:07,039
As if dinner from him comes free!

587
00:21:07,279 --> 00:21:08,240
Whenever he treats,

588
00:21:08,319 --> 00:21:10,000
he's either selling us stuff or asking to borrow money.

589
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,039
When has it ever been a good thing?

590
00:21:11,519 --> 00:21:12,480
This time around,

591
00:21:13,279 --> 00:21:15,000
he's definitely after Dad's demolition payout.

592
00:21:15,559 --> 00:21:17,680
He wants to egg us on to speak up with him.

593
00:21:18,039 --> 00:21:18,559
If he wants to ask,

594
00:21:18,559 --> 00:21:19,680
let him ask himself.

595
00:21:20,319 --> 00:21:21,319
Why drag us into it?

596
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:22,519
Don't you dare go.

597
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:23,599
Fine, fine.

598
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,559
Uncle!

599
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:43,680
Uncle Duoxi!

600
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:45,839
Who is it? Uncle!

601
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:51,000
Uncle Duoxi!

602
00:21:51,720 --> 00:21:52,200
Who is it?

603
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:52,880
Who?

604
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,039
Pounding so hard... Uncle!

605
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:56,240
Uncle!

606
00:21:56,319 --> 00:21:56,599
Jiao?

607
00:21:56,599 --> 00:21:56,920
Uncle!

608
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:58,079
Quick, hurry!

609
00:21:58,079 --> 00:21:59,720
What is it? What's going on?

610
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:00,359
Something's happened!

611
00:22:00,799 --> 00:22:01,160
At our place!

612
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:01,839
Where did what happen?

613
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:02,680
At our construction site!

614
00:22:02,759 --> 00:22:03,079
Hold on a second.

615
00:22:03,079 --> 00:22:04,000
Come with me first!

616
00:22:04,079 --> 00:22:04,880
Just hold on a second.

617
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:06,319
I need... I need to change.

618
00:22:06,319 --> 00:22:07,279
I was using the toilet!

619
00:22:07,279 --> 00:22:07,640
Just wait.

620
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,720
Hurry up, Uncle!

621
00:22:10,559 --> 00:22:12,480
Someone spread a rumor...

622
00:22:12,799 --> 00:22:14,839
that my dad won't wake up,

623
00:22:15,359 --> 00:22:17,200
and the Ma family site can't go on.

624
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,720
Now the workers are revolting!

625
00:22:19,359 --> 00:22:19,759
Don't panic.

626
00:22:19,759 --> 00:22:20,079
And then?

627
00:22:20,079 --> 00:22:20,599
Don't panic.

628
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,160
Isn't it just about money?

629
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:22,759
Don't mind them.

630
00:22:23,160 --> 00:22:23,640
Take it easy.

631
00:22:25,559 --> 00:22:25,880
Eldest,

632
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:27,400
get over here right now.

633
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:28,960
Let's meet at the Ma family's site.

634
00:22:30,119 --> 00:22:30,640
Withdraw the money.

635
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:31,119
Okay.

636
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:34,759
Please enter your PIN.

637
00:22:35,039 --> 00:22:38,079
Corporate ticket 006, please go to Window 1.

638
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:42,160
Incorrect PIN. Please try again.

639
00:22:48,599 --> 00:22:49,319
Still incorrect.

640
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:51,640
Excuse me, ma'am...

641
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,359
this is my dad's passbook.

642
00:22:53,359 --> 00:22:54,480
I'm his biological daughter.

643
00:22:54,839 --> 00:22:57,000
He's in a coma in the hospital and can't come.

644
00:22:57,279 --> 00:22:58,400
We desperately need this money.

645
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,759
Could you... could you please help us out?

646
00:23:00,039 --> 00:23:01,240
He's in a coma.

647
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:01,920
He, he, he...

648
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,640
There really is nothing I can do.

649
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,519
It's bank policy.

650
00:23:03,599 --> 00:23:04,960
Why don't you try to think again?

651
00:23:05,519 --> 00:23:05,920
Uncle...

652
00:23:06,319 --> 00:23:07,079
Don't worry, take it easy.

653
00:23:08,519 --> 00:23:09,480
Can I give it a try?

654
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:10,279
Go ahead.

655
00:23:19,319 --> 00:23:19,720
Is it right?

656
00:23:20,799 --> 00:23:21,200
That's correct.

657
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,359
How much would you like to withdraw?

658
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:25,200
How... how much should we get, Uncle?

659
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,039
Let's... let's take out 200,000 first.

660
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:29,759
200,000.

661
00:23:30,119 --> 00:23:30,640
Just a moment.

662
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:34,200
Uncle...

663
00:23:34,839 --> 00:23:36,720
How did you know my dad's PIN?

664
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:38,920
There's plenty I know.

665
00:23:39,839 --> 00:23:41,680
A whole house of children...

666
00:23:41,839 --> 00:23:43,319
is no match for a brother of many years.

667
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:49,640
Waiter!

668
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:50,799
Excuse me!

669
00:23:51,519 --> 00:23:52,240
Sorry to bother you.

670
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:53,480
One more plate of this.

671
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:54,480
Right away!

672
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:56,240
Sir, when should we start serving the food?

673
00:23:56,839 --> 00:23:57,599
When the guests arrive.

674
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,519
I'll call you in a bit.

675
00:23:58,759 --> 00:23:59,079
All right.

676
00:23:59,079 --> 00:24:00,400
Thanks, thank you so much.

677
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:11,920
Wait, bro.

678
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,000
Wait, have you left yet?

679
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,680
Didn't we agree I was treating today?

680
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,319
Don't... don't...

681
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:19,759
The Ma family's construction site?

682
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:22,480
Wait, are you serious?

683
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,599
Don't lie to me about this.

684
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:24,039
What the hell are you...

685
00:24:48,559 --> 00:24:48,880
Fine.

686
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,079
These two...

687
00:24:50,079 --> 00:24:50,519
All right.

688
00:24:58,119 --> 00:24:59,559
Spit it out already!

689
00:24:59,559 --> 00:25:00,039
Second Brother.

690
00:25:00,319 --> 00:25:01,160
Wait, where are you guys?

691
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:03,880
Didn't we agree I'd treat you to dinner today?

692
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:05,240
Who has time to eat with you?

693
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:06,200
Finish eating yourself

694
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,599
and take the rest to go.

695
00:25:07,599 --> 00:25:08,200
I told you,

696
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:10,519
I've got serious business to discuss today.

697
00:25:10,519 --> 00:25:11,559
You need to come talk it over.

698
00:25:11,559 --> 00:25:12,319
Nothing to discuss.

699
00:25:12,559 --> 00:25:13,759
Your second sister-in-law and I are busy.

700
00:25:14,240 --> 00:25:14,720
We don't have time for you.

701
00:25:15,079 --> 00:25:16,119
Then hand her the phone.

702
00:25:16,279 --> 00:25:17,039
I'm not talking to you.

703
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:18,240
Sai Xiuhe,

704
00:25:19,319 --> 00:25:20,480
you've got some nerve calling me.

705
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:23,680
How about I come over and find you two?

706
00:25:26,039 --> 00:25:26,440
Sure.

707
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:28,359
We're on Binhai Road,

708
00:25:28,599 --> 00:25:29,680
at Lisu Gym.

709
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:30,240
Come on over.

710
00:25:30,359 --> 00:25:31,319
Got it. Be right there.

711
00:25:32,720 --> 00:25:34,519
Why'd you have him come?

712
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,440
To watch the show.

713
00:25:35,519 --> 00:25:36,319
Did you buy a ticket?

714
00:25:36,319 --> 00:25:37,039
You and your show.

715
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,359
Free shows are the best.

716
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:44,519
Dad,

717
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:45,680
do you know what to say?

718
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:46,799
Don't worry.

719
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:48,160
Just leave it to me.

720
00:25:48,359 --> 00:25:48,640
Let's go.

721
00:26:17,599 --> 00:26:18,119
Give me five.

722
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:22,279
Second Sister-in-law.

723
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:23,920
You know, on my way here,

724
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:25,079
I was thinking about something.

725
00:26:25,480 --> 00:26:27,440
I wondered why you got to be a big star.

726
00:26:27,839 --> 00:26:29,160
Now I see it's because you're so disciplined.

727
00:26:29,319 --> 00:26:30,400
I really need to learn from you.

728
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,160
You got here fast.

729
00:26:32,519 --> 00:26:33,279
Of course I did.

730
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:35,359
What do you want to talk about?

731
00:26:36,319 --> 00:26:37,839
You already know my situation.

732
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:38,920
Your second brother right now

733
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,319
can barely save his own skin.

734
00:26:40,319 --> 00:26:41,920
I wasn't even looking for you.

735
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,200
I came to talk to my sister-in-law.

736
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:45,920
Sister-in-law, let me break it down for you.

737
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:47,680
You need money to buy a new house, right?

738
00:26:48,279 --> 00:26:49,720
Number Two needs money to open his law firm, right?

739
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:51,759
And for you to live like a pretty princess,

740
00:26:51,759 --> 00:26:52,519
that takes money too, doesn't it?

741
00:26:52,839 --> 00:26:53,680
It's useless talking to me.

742
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:54,880
My last name isn't Sai.

743
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:56,079
Sister-in-law,

744
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:56,759
you...

745
00:26:57,519 --> 00:26:58,279
Whether your name is Sai or not,

746
00:26:58,279 --> 00:26:59,920
we're still family now, right?

747
00:27:00,119 --> 00:27:00,640
Besides, Number Two

748
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:02,759
is the most henpecked husband in Qingyangli.

749
00:27:03,079 --> 00:27:04,319
Help me talk some sense into him.

750
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:05,960
Why don't you tell me,

751
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:08,680
why are you so obsessed with splitting this money?

752
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:10,440
Why shouldn't we split it?

753
00:27:10,839 --> 00:27:12,160
The money is just sitting right there.

754
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:13,160
Splitting it doesn't need an excuse.

755
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,200
Not splitting it is what needs an excuse.

756
00:27:14,519 --> 00:27:15,279
Drop the act.

757
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,240
You don't want money?

758
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:16,799
At the Port Authority,

759
00:27:16,799 --> 00:27:17,680
making five or six grand a month was great.

760
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:18,279
Why open a law firm?

761
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:20,480
We can't end up like the Ma family.

762
00:27:20,599 --> 00:27:21,799
Old Man Ma called all the shots,

763
00:27:21,799 --> 00:27:22,799
and no one dared to object.

764
00:27:23,119 --> 00:27:23,759
Now that he's collapsed,

765
00:27:23,759 --> 00:27:24,359
the money hasn't even been divided,

766
00:27:24,359 --> 00:27:25,240
and no one got anything out of it.

767
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:26,960
Let's talk it over today

768
00:27:27,440 --> 00:27:28,000
and come up with a plan.

769
00:27:30,599 --> 00:27:31,960
What kind of man Uncle Ma is,

770
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:33,599
don't you all know?

771
00:27:34,079 --> 00:27:35,160
When has he ever owed you money?

772
00:27:36,039 --> 00:27:37,440
If he really dared to stiff you,

773
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:39,559
he wouldn't even be able to return to our village.

774
00:27:39,920 --> 00:27:41,440
Now that Uncle Ma is in trouble,

775
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:43,640
you brothers can't step up and help carry the load?

776
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,920
Now that he's lying in the hospital,

777
00:27:46,319 --> 00:27:48,960
some of you are already getting restless,

778
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:50,000
trying to jump out

779
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,000
and stir up trouble.

780
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:52,880
Anyone who wants their money today,

781
00:27:53,839 --> 00:27:55,359
I won't stand in your way.

782
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:56,559
Down to the last penny,

783
00:27:56,880 --> 00:27:57,680
you can take it and go.

784
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:58,480
How about that?

785
00:27:59,039 --> 00:28:00,440
Does anyone want to take their payout early?

786
00:28:09,319 --> 00:28:09,640
Brother Biao

787
00:28:16,079 --> 00:28:17,920
No one else wants their money early, right?

788
00:28:18,279 --> 00:28:18,720
I do.

789
00:28:23,559 --> 00:28:24,400
I'll get mine first.

790
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:25,279
Biaozi.

791
00:28:26,440 --> 00:28:27,200
What do you think you're doing?

792
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:29,799
You called us over so loudly to get paid.

793
00:28:29,799 --> 00:28:30,759
What else would I do?

794
00:28:31,519 --> 00:28:32,400
Get my pay.

795
00:28:34,599 --> 00:28:35,119
All right, fine.

796
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:36,480
Come here. Jiao,

797
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:37,400
get that...

798
00:28:38,079 --> 00:28:39,359
Give me the attendance log.

799
00:28:40,079 --> 00:28:40,440
Biaozi.

800
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:41,039
Come over here.

801
00:28:41,240 --> 00:28:41,799
Name.

802
00:28:42,079 --> 00:28:42,559
Phone number.

803
00:28:42,759 --> 00:28:44,680
Address and ID number.

804
00:28:44,799 --> 00:28:45,640
Write them all down for me.

805
00:28:45,799 --> 00:28:46,960
Sign it yourself.

806
00:28:47,039 --> 00:28:48,279
Add your thumbprint and date it.

807
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,200
Why should I?

808
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:49,960
What do you mean, why?

809
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:50,799
I'm just collecting my wages.

810
00:28:50,799 --> 00:28:51,480
Why do I have to sign anything?

811
00:28:51,480 --> 00:28:53,480
Normally, you're collecting wages,

812
00:28:53,599 --> 00:28:54,480
getting your regular pay.

813
00:28:54,720 --> 00:28:55,599
Is that what today is?

814
00:28:55,799 --> 00:28:56,440
What do you call this?

815
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:59,000
You're forcing us to pay you early.

816
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,079
Cut the crap. Come on.

817
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:01,759
Sign your name, press your thumbprint,

818
00:29:01,920 --> 00:29:02,640
and take the money.

819
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,599
Starting tomorrow...

820
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:05,920
Starting tomorrow, don't bother coming back.

821
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:06,480
On what grounds?

822
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:07,799
Who the hell are you?

823
00:29:07,799 --> 00:29:08,359
Yeah!

824
00:29:08,359 --> 00:29:09,240
Who does he think he is?

825
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,319
Just because he says so,

826
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:11,720
that's how it's gonna be?

827
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:14,279
I'm not signing!

828
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:16,480
Then tell us,

829
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:18,079
how do you plan to split this money?

830
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:19,720
On the Sai family household register,

831
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:20,720
there are seven people:

832
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:21,839
the old man, Eldest Brother,

833
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:22,680
Wen Jiayin, Zhenzhu,

834
00:29:23,079 --> 00:29:24,000
me, Fourth Sister, and Little Five.

835
00:29:24,119 --> 00:29:26,000
So those eligible to get a share

836
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,559
are really just the old man, Eldest's family,

837
00:29:27,559 --> 00:29:27,960
and me.

838
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:28,680
Hold on, hold on.

839
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:29,440
What about me?

840
00:29:29,599 --> 00:29:30,200
Right here, right here.

841
00:29:30,279 --> 00:29:31,319
Second Brother, I put you down.

842
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:32,359
I know

843
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:33,799
you're the hero of the demolition,

844
00:29:33,880 --> 00:29:35,319
and you're the old man's favorite.

845
00:29:35,319 --> 00:29:35,960
You definitely get a share.

846
00:29:36,279 --> 00:29:36,799
So,

847
00:29:36,960 --> 00:29:37,799
here is the plan:

848
00:29:38,160 --> 00:29:39,160
It's split into three shares,

849
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:40,599
Eldest, Second, and Third Brother.

850
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:42,720
The split is 40-30-30.

851
00:29:43,039 --> 00:29:44,319
Why does someone get 40%?

852
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:45,119
It's written right here:

853
00:29:45,519 --> 00:29:46,480
Whoever takes the old man

854
00:29:46,559 --> 00:29:48,240
gets an extra 10%.

855
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:49,839
I've already done the math on the money.

856
00:29:50,160 --> 00:29:51,640
It's 14.28 million in total.

857
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:53,319
How much does the 40% get?

858
00:29:53,599 --> 00:29:55,240
5.712 million.

859
00:29:55,640 --> 00:29:56,599
Those getting 30% won't lose out either:

860
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:58,039
4.284 million.

861
00:29:58,519 --> 00:29:59,480
I've already written your names here.

862
00:29:59,480 --> 00:30:00,240
Put your thumbprint right here for me.

863
00:30:00,519 --> 00:30:01,079
If you agree,

864
00:30:01,079 --> 00:30:01,839
just sign your name.

865
00:30:04,160 --> 00:30:04,920
What are you laughing at?

866
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:06,759
Setting everything else aside,

867
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,119
let me ask you just one thing.

868
00:30:08,799 --> 00:30:11,079
Why does the old man only get ten percent?

869
00:30:11,079 --> 00:30:12,599
Do you think he'd ever agree to that?

870
00:30:12,759 --> 00:30:14,079
The old man is getting on in years.

871
00:30:14,079 --> 00:30:15,519
He can't spend that much money.

872
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:16,559
Besides, he has his construction crew.

873
00:30:16,559 --> 00:30:17,440
He can earn his own living.

874
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,119
Makes sense, doesn't it?

875
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:19,960
I think he makes a good point.

876
00:30:20,559 --> 00:30:22,079
Don't... don't lead him on.

877
00:30:22,079 --> 00:30:23,440
I knew you could see the big picture.

878
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,440
S-So you agree, then?

879
00:30:27,319 --> 00:30:28,400
Forget whether the old man agrees.

880
00:30:28,599 --> 00:30:29,839
The way you're dividing this,

881
00:30:29,839 --> 00:30:31,400
when it comes to Fourth Sister and Little Five,

882
00:30:31,400 --> 00:30:32,480
if they really took it up,

883
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:33,319
it's completely illegal.

884
00:30:33,319 --> 00:30:33,680
You know that?

885
00:30:33,680 --> 00:30:34,400
Get out of here.

886
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:36,079
What does splitting money have to do with the law?

887
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:36,599
Look.

888
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,559
Fourth Sister may have married out,

889
00:30:38,559 --> 00:30:40,039
but her household registration is still with this family.

890
00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:41,559
Under the law,

891
00:30:42,319 --> 00:30:45,119
she doesn't lose her land rights just because she married.

892
00:30:45,559 --> 00:30:47,640
She has every right to the land compensation.

893
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:48,240
Got it?

894
00:30:48,400 --> 00:30:49,240
I don't give a damn about the law.

895
00:30:49,759 --> 00:30:51,640
Qingyangli has its own village rules and conventions.

896
00:30:51,799 --> 00:30:52,240
If she wants a cut,

897
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,720
she can get it from Jin Jingran's family.

898
00:30:53,720 --> 00:30:54,880
She's not touching the Sai family's money.

899
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:56,920
Why are you such a legal illiterate?

900
00:30:57,119 --> 00:30:57,839
Village conventions

901
00:30:57,839 --> 00:30:59,359
can't override national law!

902
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:00,880
Even if we took ten steps back,

903
00:31:01,319 --> 00:31:02,720
and Fourth Sister agreed,

904
00:31:03,279 --> 00:31:04,160
after how the old man treated her,

905
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:05,039
don't you know where he stands?

906
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,039
Even if she agrees,

907
00:31:06,039 --> 00:31:06,920
would the old man agree?

908
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:08,039
And what about Little Five?

909
00:31:08,400 --> 00:31:09,480
He was taken in as a foundling,

910
00:31:09,680 --> 00:31:12,160
but he's been in this family for 17 years!

911
00:31:12,319 --> 00:31:13,279
17 years!

912
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:15,000
I even got his adoption papers finalized.

913
00:31:15,119 --> 00:31:16,279
So by both reason and custom,

914
00:31:16,279 --> 00:31:17,400
he is part of the Sai family.

915
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:18,720
He's just still a minor.

916
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:19,839
So his share

917
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:21,119
ought to be with his legal guardian,

918
00:31:21,119 --> 00:31:22,200
which means the old man.

919
00:31:22,359 --> 00:31:23,559
Who are you to say he gets nothing?

920
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:24,640
You think you're bigger than the court?

921
00:31:25,799 --> 00:31:27,640
Third Brother, you've lived in this house for years,

922
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:28,920
and you still don't know who's boss?

923
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,400
As long as the old man is around,

924
00:31:30,480 --> 00:31:32,440
all your schemes are just wishful thinking.

925
00:31:32,759 --> 00:31:33,759
Knowing his temper,

926
00:31:34,079 --> 00:31:34,480
just think—

927
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:36,559
it's been almost a year since the demolition contract was signed.

928
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:37,680
You think he has no plan?

929
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:38,799
You think he hasn't thought it through?

930
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:40,200
Why are you dreaming up wild ideas?

931
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:41,519
Just do what he tells you!

932
00:31:41,839 --> 00:31:42,680
Now go back to what you're supposed to be doing.

933
00:31:43,279 --> 00:31:44,839
My brother studied law.

934
00:31:45,119 --> 00:31:46,559
Before I came here, he told me

935
00:31:47,279 --> 00:31:48,079
what you're doing is called

936
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:49,200
disrupting production

937
00:31:49,519 --> 00:31:51,559
and forcing us to pay wages early!

938
00:31:51,559 --> 00:31:52,680
Who are you trying to scare?

939
00:31:52,759 --> 00:31:53,720
Am I trying to scare you?

940
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:54,559
Let me tell you,

941
00:31:54,839 --> 00:31:55,960
we did the work,

942
00:31:56,160 --> 00:31:57,039
so we get paid!

943
00:31:57,240 --> 00:31:58,240
It's only right and fair!

944
00:31:58,480 --> 00:32:00,160
Uncle Ma is lying in a hospital bed right now.

945
00:32:00,559 --> 00:32:01,920
When he'll wake up,

946
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:02,960
nobody knows.

947
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:04,599
If something bad happens to him,

948
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:05,440
who do we ask for our money?

949
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:06,519
Yeah, who do we ask?

950
00:32:06,519 --> 00:32:07,559
The money we earned

951
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:09,200
can't just go down the drain!

952
00:32:09,839 --> 00:32:10,559
Pay us!

953
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:11,279
Give us our money!

954
00:32:11,559 --> 00:32:11,920
What are you doing?

955
00:32:12,359 --> 00:32:13,400
Jiao, record this!

956
00:32:13,759 --> 00:32:14,319
Record it right now!

957
00:32:14,319 --> 00:32:15,039
Trying to rob us, are you?

958
00:32:15,119 --> 00:32:16,200
We quit! We're not working here anymore!

959
00:32:18,359 --> 00:32:18,920
Pay up.

960
00:32:20,759 --> 00:32:21,240
Biaozi.

961
00:32:22,079 --> 00:32:22,759
Tell me.

962
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:25,640
What did Yang Er promise you?

963
00:32:26,799 --> 00:32:27,160
Yang Er?

964
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,200
Who's he?

965
00:32:28,359 --> 00:32:28,720
Don't know him.

966
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:29,440
You don't know him?

967
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:30,279
Never heard of him.

968
00:32:32,359 --> 00:32:33,200
Spit it out.

969
00:32:33,799 --> 00:32:34,440
Yang Er...

970
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,079
what did he promise you?

971
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:37,000
Uncle...

972
00:32:38,039 --> 00:32:40,759
Uncle, uncle, who is this Yang Er?

973
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:41,960
What promises?

974
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:42,960
What are you talking about?

975
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:44,119
I have no clue!

976
00:32:44,319 --> 00:32:45,680
Still playing dumb, are you?

977
00:32:45,839 --> 00:32:47,640
I, Sai Duoxi, have worked construction

978
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:49,200
for nearly twenty years.

979
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:50,240
I know how this works.

980
00:32:50,799 --> 00:32:51,559
You tell Yang Er

981
00:32:51,839 --> 00:32:53,039
Old Ma won't die.

982
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:54,759
If he wants to play dirty,

983
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:56,319
he'd better watch out,

984
00:32:57,119 --> 00:32:58,519
or heaven will strike him down!

985
00:33:02,039 --> 00:33:03,400
Let me say a few words to everyone too.

986
00:33:04,119 --> 00:33:05,599
You want your money? Fine.

987
00:33:06,039 --> 00:33:06,720
Take it right now.

988
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:10,160
Take the cash, sign, and leave your thumbprint.

989
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:13,119
From now on, we go our separate ways.

990
00:33:13,559 --> 00:33:14,880
I refuse to believe

991
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:16,119
this site of mine

992
00:33:16,319 --> 00:33:17,720
will fall apart just because you leave.

993
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:18,559
Remember this:

994
00:33:19,799 --> 00:33:20,759
whatever happens to the Mas

995
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:22,480
is the business of us Sais!

996
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:23,759
Now what do we do?

997
00:33:36,759 --> 00:33:37,440
Either keep working for now,

998
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:38,359
Head back, head back, head back.

999
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:40,839
Anyone who can go back to work now,

1000
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:42,599
just go back and get to work.

1001
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:44,640
You won't be shorted a single penny.

1002
00:33:44,920 --> 00:33:45,759
All right, stop making a fuss.

1003
00:33:45,759 --> 00:33:46,240
Let's go.

1004
00:33:47,119 --> 00:33:47,839
We're heading out first.

1005
00:33:48,640 --> 00:33:49,599
Those of you staying behind,

1006
00:33:49,960 --> 00:33:50,440
sign here,

1007
00:33:50,759 --> 00:33:51,279
and press your thumbprints.

1008
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:54,240
Brother Biao, there's something you need to handle over there.

1009
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:55,000
Brother Biao, let's go.

1010
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:56,279
Brother Biao.

1011
00:33:56,279 --> 00:33:57,440
Uncle, I'm heading over to deal with that first.

1012
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:57,799
Brother Biao, let's go.

1013
00:33:57,799 --> 00:33:58,559
You're not collecting yours?

1014
00:33:58,559 --> 00:33:59,599
I've got too much to deal with over there.

1015
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:01,960
Little bastard.

1016
00:34:04,359 --> 00:34:04,720
Xiuming,

1017
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,759
go with Lai Jiao and deposit this money right away.

1018
00:34:07,480 --> 00:34:07,759
Hurry.

1019
00:34:08,320 --> 00:34:09,360
Thank you,

1020
00:34:09,719 --> 00:34:10,480
Brother Xiuming.

1021
00:34:12,039 --> 00:34:12,480
Third Brother,

1022
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,079
why are you in such a rush to split this money?

1023
00:34:14,079 --> 00:34:14,559
What for?

1024
00:34:14,679 --> 00:34:15,519
To do business!

1025
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:17,079
Honey, do you know what he's done in the past?

1026
00:34:17,239 --> 00:34:18,119
You've sold phone cards,

1027
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:19,719
peddled tea,

1028
00:34:20,119 --> 00:34:21,079
and even resold rebar.

1029
00:34:21,639 --> 00:34:22,480
He even sold dogs!

1030
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:25,159
You fail at everything you touch,

1031
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:26,280
and lose money on everything you do.

1032
00:34:26,519 --> 00:34:27,280
Eldest Brother had to collect your debts,

1033
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:28,719
I had to bail you out at the police station,

1034
00:34:29,119 --> 00:34:30,280
Dad had to clean up your financial messes,

1035
00:34:30,639 --> 00:34:32,039
and even underage Xiaowu

1036
00:34:32,039 --> 00:34:33,519
had to sign a confession for you!

1037
00:34:33,599 --> 00:34:34,239
Come on, look at me.

1038
00:34:34,400 --> 00:34:34,800
Let me tell you,

1039
00:34:35,079 --> 00:34:36,360
whenever there's demolition,

1040
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:37,440
do you know how many people

1041
00:34:37,440 --> 00:34:38,719
are eyeing that payout money?

1042
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:40,119
With your brains,

1043
00:34:40,400 --> 00:34:41,559
and your reckless, clueless attitude,

1044
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:43,679
those scheming scammers

1045
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:45,280
will clean you out in under three days!

1046
00:34:45,679 --> 00:34:46,880
Stop airing my dirty laundry!

1047
00:34:47,159 --> 00:34:48,360
You running a law firm counts as making money,

1048
00:34:48,679 --> 00:34:49,920
but me doing business counts as losing money?

1049
00:34:50,360 --> 00:34:51,880
You being timid is called "hardworking,"

1050
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:53,000
but me being bold is called "fooling around"?

1051
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:54,599
Seriously, on what grounds?

1052
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:55,559
Let's not even talk about that.

1053
00:34:55,719 --> 00:34:56,320
Just take the old man.

1054
00:34:56,519 --> 00:34:57,599
He's lived in the dirt his whole life,

1055
00:34:57,719 --> 00:34:58,559
bowing and scraping his whole life.

1056
00:34:58,559 --> 00:34:59,159
Did he make any money?

1057
00:34:59,159 --> 00:34:59,960
Did he get rich?

1058
00:35:00,239 --> 00:35:02,119
This single demolition order brought over 14 million!

1059
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:03,679
Even if our whole family pooled together

1060
00:35:03,679 --> 00:35:05,079
and worked 800 years, could we make this much?

1061
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:06,800
"Hardworking," my ass!

1062
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:08,039
Without reform and opening up,

1063
00:35:08,039 --> 00:35:09,159
without joining the WTO,

1064
00:35:09,159 --> 00:35:10,199
and without the real estate boom,

1065
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:12,199
the old man would still be toiling in the dirt and pulling a cart!

1066
00:35:12,400 --> 00:35:14,880
It's 2008, dear brother!

1067
00:35:15,079 --> 00:35:16,559
The Olympics are already over!

1068
00:35:16,559 --> 00:35:17,639
What kind of era are we in now?

1069
00:35:17,880 --> 00:35:19,440
It's the era of investment!

1070
00:35:19,639 --> 00:35:21,039
Stop glorifying suffering!

1071
00:35:21,039 --> 00:35:22,400
What, are you guys addicted to suffering?

1072
00:35:22,400 --> 00:35:23,400
Don't get so worked up.

1073
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:24,400
Let me ask you:

1074
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,199
you coming here today,

1075
00:35:25,199 --> 00:35:25,840
does Dad know?

1076
00:35:26,519 --> 00:35:27,320
What difference does it make if he knows or not?

1077
00:35:29,239 --> 00:35:30,159
Dad is still alive!

1078
00:35:30,159 --> 00:35:31,280
You coming here to split the money,

1079
00:35:31,519 --> 00:35:32,199
in ancient times,

1080
00:35:32,199 --> 00:35:33,280
that'd be considered treason!

1081
00:35:33,400 --> 00:35:34,199
Dragging us into this...

1082
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:34,679
Listen to that.

1083
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:36,719
It's not a royal throne.

1084
00:35:36,719 --> 00:35:37,679
What treason?

1085
00:35:37,679 --> 00:35:39,199
Th-This... it's not the same thing at all!

1086
00:35:39,280 --> 00:35:40,880
I'll still be as filial as I should be,

1087
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:41,960
but I want my cut of the money, too.

1088
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:42,920
They don't conflict!

1089
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:43,480
Sai Xiuhe,

1090
00:35:43,599 --> 00:35:44,320
in this family,

1091
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,440
they are the exact same thing.

1092
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:46,480
Listen to your second sister-in-law.

1093
00:35:46,719 --> 00:35:47,239
Let's go.

1094
00:35:48,039 --> 00:35:49,119
Let's pretend we never met.

1095
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:50,000
Come on, let's go.

1096
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:50,239
No.

1097
00:35:50,239 --> 00:35:50,480
Leave.

1098
00:35:51,199 --> 00:35:52,360
Shouldn't we treat Third Brother to a meal?

1099
00:35:52,880 --> 00:35:53,800
Fine, you stay.

1100
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:54,719
Who wants to eat with you?

1101
00:35:58,039 --> 00:35:59,400
Actively responding to national policy,

1102
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:01,480
the Honggang municipal government took action

1103
00:36:01,960 --> 00:36:03,920
to vigorously promote the smart wharf project,

1104
00:36:04,480 --> 00:36:07,280
comprehensively upgrading Dawazi Wharf.

1105
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,159
I'm at home.

1106
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:22,039
Back so early?

1107
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:23,119
Done eating.

1108
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:26,079
Did your second sister-in-law go?

1109
00:36:26,079 --> 00:36:27,000
Is that any of your business?

1110
00:36:28,119 --> 00:36:29,559
You're acting pretty high and mighty now.

1111
00:36:29,559 --> 00:36:31,079
Couldn't even get you to come out to eat.

1112
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:33,400
Things came up at the site.

1113
00:36:33,599 --> 00:36:35,039
People were making trouble at the Ma family's site.

1114
00:36:35,679 --> 00:36:37,280
Dad took your big brother over to check it out.

1115
00:36:37,280 --> 00:36:38,360
They haven't even come back yet.

1116
00:36:38,719 --> 00:36:39,559
And at our site,

1117
00:36:39,559 --> 00:36:41,000
a difficult young supervisor showed up.

1118
00:36:41,800 --> 00:36:43,199
He's withholding our payout and won't settle.

1119
00:36:43,599 --> 00:36:44,320
Dad's face was

1120
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:45,360
darker than the bottom of a pot.

1121
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:46,880
It's not the diligent or the lazy who get hit,

1122
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:47,760
it's the ones who lack sense.

1123
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:50,400
You can go out living it up, wining and dining,

1124
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:51,920
but I don't dare walk into the line of fire.

1125
00:36:51,920 --> 00:36:52,639
Keep making things up.

1126
00:36:53,239 --> 00:36:54,599
How do you spin these sob stories

1127
00:36:54,599 --> 00:36:55,679
one after another?

1128
00:36:55,760 --> 00:36:57,159
Didn't we just get some supervisor locked up?

1129
00:36:57,159 --> 00:36:58,360
How did another one pop up?

1130
00:36:58,360 --> 00:36:59,119
Have I lost my mind?

1131
00:36:59,119 --> 00:37:00,800
Why would I jinx our own site like that?

1132
00:37:01,119 --> 00:37:02,000
The old supervisor left,

1133
00:37:02,239 --> 00:37:03,199
and a young supervisor came along.

1134
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:05,079
The old one was all shakedowns and kickbacks,

1135
00:37:05,239 --> 00:37:06,400
while the young one plays it strictly by the book.

1136
00:37:06,679 --> 00:37:08,199
With someone doing shakedowns and kickbacks, you know what he wants.

1137
00:37:08,559 --> 00:37:10,039
Those by-the-book types are tough nuts to crack.

1138
00:37:10,039 --> 00:37:11,280
I don't even know where to bite into him.

1139
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:12,559
Dad said

1140
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:14,320
we must get the Phase Two payment before the holiday.

1141
00:37:14,599 --> 00:37:15,360
Dinner? Please!

1142
00:37:16,239 --> 00:37:18,119
Your brother and I can't even sleep.

1143
00:37:22,719 --> 00:37:23,239
Third Brother,

1144
00:37:23,599 --> 00:37:24,719
you've got broad connections.

1145
00:37:25,079 --> 00:37:26,599
Ask around for your brother,

1146
00:37:26,599 --> 00:37:27,840
and find out whose side this young supervisor is on.

1147
00:37:27,840 --> 00:37:28,280
Not helping.

1148
00:37:28,280 --> 00:37:28,920
Why are you being so difficult?

1149
00:37:30,239 --> 00:37:31,960
Look, to be honest about you two,

1150
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:33,480
you only care when you need someone.

1151
00:37:33,639 --> 00:37:35,119
Bailing people out, finding people, you come to me.

1152
00:37:35,119 --> 00:37:36,159
But then, when I invite you to dinner,

1153
00:37:36,159 --> 00:37:36,599
neither of you shows up.

1154
00:37:36,599 --> 00:37:37,280
Don't I have my pride?

1155
00:37:37,280 --> 00:37:38,920
I know you want your cut.

1156
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:41,199
If your brother and I don't collect this payment,

1157
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,519
we won't have any leverage to speak up.

1158
00:37:42,679 --> 00:37:43,480
Don't you get that?

1159
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,039
Fine, help or don't.

1160
00:37:45,280 --> 00:37:46,199
The two of us will figure it out ourselves.

1161
00:37:53,639 --> 00:37:54,079
What's his name?

1162
00:37:54,559 --> 00:37:54,880
What?

1163
00:37:55,239 --> 00:37:55,920
The young supervisor.

1164
00:37:56,320 --> 00:37:56,679
What's his name?

1165
00:37:58,400 --> 00:37:59,039
Guo Haifeng.

1166
00:37:59,719 --> 00:38:00,239
Wait for word tomorrow.

1167
00:38:06,199 --> 00:38:07,079
How did your chat

1168
00:38:08,559 --> 00:38:09,239
with Second Brother go?

1169
00:38:09,679 --> 00:38:10,239
How did it go?

1170
00:38:10,840 --> 00:38:11,440
How else could it go?

1171
00:38:12,159 --> 00:38:13,440
Just another of Daddy's precious little boys.

1172
00:38:23,519 --> 00:38:25,400
Kid, three yuan for one, five for two.

1173
00:38:27,199 --> 00:38:28,320
Coming right up! Coming right up!

1174
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:30,559
Here you go, your steamed buns.

1175
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:32,880
Roasted sweet potatoes!

1176
00:38:33,679 --> 00:38:35,199
Sweet and soft roasted sweet potatoes!

1177
00:38:35,199 --> 00:38:37,000
Fried dough, steamed buns, tofu pudding!

1178
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:37,719
Fried shredded pancakes, fried noodles!

1179
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:39,800
Fried dough, steamed buns, tofu pudding!

1180
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:53,400
Hey, Xiuhe.

1181
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:53,800
Sister-in-law.

1182
00:38:54,519 --> 00:38:55,960
I looked into the situation for you.

1183
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,400
You guys just had rotten luck.

1184
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,159
The older supervisor and the younger supervisor...

1185
00:38:59,159 --> 00:39:00,320
are actually uncle and nephew.

1186
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,960
You just got the older one locked up

1187
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:03,960
and lost him his job.

1188
00:39:04,199 --> 00:39:05,639
Naturally, the younger one is screwing with you.

1189
00:39:06,079 --> 00:39:06,840
What a coincidence.

1190
00:39:07,400 --> 00:39:09,239
I'll see this through for you.

1191
00:39:09,639 --> 00:39:11,119
The younger supervisor is getting married soon.

1192
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:13,239
His fiancée is a kindergarten teacher,

1193
00:39:13,400 --> 00:39:14,320
probably someone who cares about appearances.

1194
00:39:14,800 --> 00:39:15,599
I found an accomplice.

1195
00:39:16,559 --> 00:39:17,519
If she plays her cards right,

1196
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:19,719
she might help you get your money back.

1197
00:39:20,239 --> 00:39:20,920
I'll text you the address.

1198
00:39:21,079 --> 00:39:21,880
Let's meet up there.

1199
00:39:22,559 --> 00:39:22,880
All right.

1200
00:39:27,119 --> 00:39:27,679
Let's go, girl.

1201
00:39:30,199 --> 00:39:30,960
Pay me first.

1202
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:31,760
As agreed.

1203
00:39:34,719 --> 00:39:36,320
Take my money and do the job.

1204
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:37,599
Deal.

1205
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:39,119
Once we get there, make a huge scene for me.

1206
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:42,199
Let's move.

1207
00:39:47,119 --> 00:39:47,639
Over here, here, here.

1208
00:39:51,079 --> 00:39:51,480
Let's go.

1209
00:39:53,960 --> 00:39:54,440
Who is she?

1210
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:55,599
His ex-girlfriend.

1211
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:56,320
She knows martial arts.

1212
00:39:57,119 --> 00:39:58,360
She'll raise holy hell in a minute,

1213
00:39:58,480 --> 00:39:59,440
and you press him hard for the money.

1214
00:39:59,559 --> 00:40:01,079
We'll definitely get the project payment back.

1215
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:06,239
Pay me more.

1216
00:40:07,920 --> 00:40:09,159
Raising the price on the spot isn't fair.

1217
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:09,880
200.

1218
00:40:11,719 --> 00:40:12,159
200.

1219
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:14,679
I didn't bring cash.

1220
00:40:17,159 --> 00:40:17,480
Hello.

1221
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:27,960
Hello.

1222
00:40:45,079 --> 00:40:45,440
Right here.

1223
00:40:45,960 --> 00:40:46,679
Knock on the door yourselves.

1224
00:40:56,039 --> 00:40:56,760
Anyone home?

1225
00:40:59,039 --> 00:40:59,760
Xiao Guo.

1226
00:41:01,199 --> 00:41:02,000
And you are?

1227
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:03,119
Supervisor Guo.

1228
00:41:04,199 --> 00:41:06,119
I'm Sai Xiuming's wife.

1229
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:07,719
Wait, don't close the door!

1230
00:41:08,039 --> 00:41:08,480
Let us in.

1231
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:09,320
We need to talk to you.

1232
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:10,239
Are you people done yet?

1233
00:41:10,239 --> 00:41:10,960
This is my home.

1234
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:12,000
If you have an issue, take it to the site.

1235
00:41:12,039 --> 00:41:12,760
Thinking of running?

1236
00:41:13,159 --> 00:41:14,440
You took my money and did nothing, huh?

1237
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:15,719
There's someone you need to meet.

1238
00:41:16,039 --> 00:41:16,440
Recognize her?

1239
00:41:18,239 --> 00:41:18,519
Speak up.

1240
00:41:19,199 --> 00:41:19,920
Let's talk about her.

1241
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:21,320
Talk!

1242
00:41:23,639 --> 00:41:24,119
Out of the way.

1243
00:41:26,559 --> 00:41:27,039
Get lost.

1244
00:41:28,559 --> 00:41:28,960
Come on in.

1245
00:41:34,199 --> 00:41:34,840
Scared you, didn't it?

1246
00:41:35,079 --> 00:41:35,440
Just you wait.

1247
00:41:36,159 --> 00:41:37,519
Are you people ever going to stop?

1248
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:39,320
You people are really something.

1249
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:40,679
This is my home.

1250
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,079
Take your business to the construction site.

1251
00:41:42,079 --> 00:41:42,559
Easy there, little brother.

1252
00:41:42,559 --> 00:41:43,519
You're trespassing on private property!

1253
00:41:43,519 --> 00:41:44,360
I can call the police, you know!

1254
00:41:44,360 --> 00:41:44,880
Call the police for what?

1255
00:41:45,679 --> 00:41:46,280
To get yourself arrested?

1256
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,960
The former supervisor was your real uncle, right?

1257
00:41:48,159 --> 00:41:49,800
He went to prison for his own crimes.

1258
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,400
Now that you're a junior supervisor,

1259
00:41:51,400 --> 00:41:52,639
you're making things difficult for our family.

1260
00:41:52,639 --> 00:41:53,840
Abusing power for a personal grudge isn't right.

1261
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:55,039
How about I write a report on you

1262
00:41:55,239 --> 00:41:55,679
and send it straight to your company?

1263
00:41:55,679 --> 00:41:56,000
You—

1264
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:57,519
Why the hell are you tagging along with them?

1265
00:41:57,599 --> 00:41:58,679
What on earth are you wearing?

1266
00:41:58,840 --> 00:41:59,159
Don't touch her!

1267
00:41:59,159 --> 00:42:00,000
Look at this hair of yours!

1268
00:42:00,519 --> 00:42:01,599
Keep your hands off her!

1269
00:42:01,599 --> 00:42:02,400
She's just a young girl.

1270
00:42:02,400 --> 00:42:03,079
What are you doing?

1271
00:42:03,079 --> 00:42:03,960
Didn't I give you money?

1272
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:04,519
Answer me!

1273
00:42:04,599 --> 00:42:05,320
You dyed your hair red,

1274
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:06,280
but you're not so tough after all, are you?

1275
00:42:06,280 --> 00:42:07,360
His wedding photo is hanging right there!

1276
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:08,239
Go make a scene with him!

1277
00:42:08,239 --> 00:42:09,400
What the hell are you talking about?

1278
00:42:09,760 --> 00:42:10,960
Can you watch your damn mouth?

1279
00:42:11,199 --> 00:42:12,320
She's my cousin!

1280
00:42:12,719 --> 00:42:14,480
The supervisor you framed and sent to prison...

1281
00:42:14,559 --> 00:42:15,280
is her father!

1282
00:42:31,960 --> 00:42:33,159
You really know how to play around, huh?

1283
00:42:37,719 --> 00:42:38,519
How is he?

1284
00:42:39,239 --> 00:42:41,800
The doctor said he's stable,

1285
00:42:42,320 --> 00:42:43,559
but he hasn't woken up yet.

1286
00:42:44,800 --> 00:42:45,239
Jiao,

1287
00:42:46,239 --> 00:42:47,400
go grab something to eat.

1288
00:42:48,199 --> 00:42:48,800
I'll stay with him.

1289
00:42:49,559 --> 00:42:50,480
Go on, it's fine.

1290
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:52,199
You must be exhausted too.

1291
00:42:54,320 --> 00:42:54,800
Go on. Go.

1292
00:43:06,960 --> 00:43:08,239
Slept enough yet?

1293
00:43:09,519 --> 00:43:10,639
Time to get up.

1294
00:43:20,039 --> 00:43:22,239
Are you hiding something from me?

1295
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:23,519
Look, anyway...

1296
00:43:23,519 --> 00:43:25,360
it's just that this has nothing to do with you.

1297
00:43:25,719 --> 00:43:26,840
Nothing to do with me, right?

1298
00:43:26,960 --> 00:43:27,480
Today,

1299
00:43:27,800 --> 00:43:30,400
I'll just consider my warm intentions wasted on you.

1300
00:43:30,559 --> 00:43:31,480
I want this much.

1301
00:43:31,599 --> 00:43:32,360
As for the other half,

1302
00:43:32,480 --> 00:43:33,519
Dad can give it to whoever he wants.

1303
00:43:33,760 --> 00:43:34,440
How much?

1304
00:43:34,679 --> 00:43:35,199
Sai Xiuhe,

1305
00:43:35,559 --> 00:43:37,000
search your conscience!

1306
00:43:37,159 --> 00:43:38,679
If your eldest brother and I hadn't

1307
00:43:38,679 --> 00:43:39,440
held this household together inside and out,

1308
00:43:39,440 --> 00:43:40,239
it would've fallen apart long ago!

1309
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:40,920
Let me tell you,

1310
00:43:40,920 --> 00:43:41,440
if you push me too far,

1311
00:43:41,440 --> 00:43:42,360
I'll expose that the second brother quit,

1312
00:43:42,360 --> 00:43:43,159
and blab it all out!

1313
00:43:43,440 --> 00:43:44,800
Then let's see who gets any money!
